{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08923","headline":"对雨 · 李白","name":"对雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卷帘聊举目，露湿草绵芊。\n古岫藏云毳，空庭织碎烟。\n水纹愁不起，风线重难牵。\n尽日扶犂叟，往来江树前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08923.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08923","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}